{"id":"n71696-3-7","stage":1,"title":"일어나다 · 发生","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71696-3-7-1","ko":"둘이 왜 싸운 거니?","zh":"你们俩为什么吵架了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"둘이","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘이","audio":"/audio/2ef3d078f170aff7e805.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"싸운","meaning":"吵架、争执","explanation":"싸우다：吵架、争执；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸운","audio":"/audio/9555c84b343dcb78c2da.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"吵架、争执","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"吵架、争执","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda75