}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸움이","audio":"/audio/1e97cfb1c80fcbba7b4f.mp3"}},{"text":"일어난","meaning":"发生，起","explanation":"일어나다：发生，起；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"3","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어난","audio":"/audio/dcc84cb23c54d14cf80a.mp3"}},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거：所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거예요","audio":"/audio/ce83694d33e9399b0229.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"4ecff0aab1862eb9","term":"장난","zh":"闹着玩，开玩笑","audio":"/audio/4ecff0aab1862eb976b8.mp3","entryId":"24799","definition":"孩子们为了好玩或消遣而而做的事情。","pronunciation":["장난"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"开玩笑、嬉闹（장난을 치다）","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"开玩笑、嬉闹（장난을 치다）","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"4239ef3beaa33c34","term":"싸움","zh":"争斗，打架，战斗","audio":"/audio/4239ef3beaa33c340c05.mp3","entryId":"24286","definition":"为了战胜对方，凭借口舌、力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸움"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"发生，起","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"事情或事件等产生。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"所说的事情、情况（것 的口语形式）","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/a50d3f0d2e73e0054639.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.816,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71696","label":"国立国语院韩国语—